Hive2Home is a honey traceability and smart-beekeeping application that connects:

Farmer → Hive → Honey Batch → QR Code → Consumer Verification → Blockchain Hash

The consumer scans a QR code attached to a honey batch and can verify:

Whether the batch is registered
Farmer information
Hive information
Bee species
Harvest/batch details
Blockchain-style SHA-256 traceability hash
Authenticity status
